## Interface: 16000, 16001
## Title: JuztLevel - Professions
## Notes: Multi-profession Forever planner with guarded native production execution, all-profession workflow registration and staged research, build-qualified evidence, and persistent Auction House/bank planning data.
## Author: Daniel / OpenAI
## Version: 0.34.236-p0-first-aid-continuity-owner-travel-tests
## X-M37-Flight-Cache: Native taxi CURRENT/REACHABLE positive observations persisted per character GUID; build/faction/locale scoped; no false unlock inference; user still boards manually
## X-M36-Flight-Routing: Unknown flight unlocks remain available only as conditional fallbacks; confirmed taxi access preferred; non-flight routes prioritized; no unlock inference
## X-M17-Canonical-Travel: Excel 70450; 47 nodes, 162 routes; all registered links route-considered regardless of verification label; actual access rules checked; no native travel rights
## X-M35-Map-Transitions: Attested city/exterior map gates and qualified transport graph; advisory route stages only; client-observed map changes; no inferred terrain paths or transport boarding
## X-M26-Transport-Audit: 35 flight masters (workbook headline says 36), 150 flight + 8 zeppelin + 4 boat; alternate map system tracked; no auto-boarding
## X-M15-Materials-Sources: Build 70450 read-only unified recipe/reagent/inventory/acquisition; build isolation; zero native permission
## X-M32-Fishing: Shared itemID filters, Fish.zip item-icon identity, historical grid-area annotations; no invented pool points or walkability
## X-M29-Objective-Tracker: 70450 own read-only overlay; all 12 profession models; build and observation qualified; above/left non-overlapping dock; native tracker never mutated
## X-M28-Economy: Build 70450 read-only per-current-step/basket receipts; bank cached vs live; AH build+scope+time+item proof; unknown != zero; no purchase/native rights
## X-M27-Gathering-Waypoint: Explicit opt-in; two same-map client observations; route revision guarded; foreign user waypoint protected; normalized proximity is not walkability
## X-M14-Gathering-Pathing: Source/observation/skill revision-bound routes; FROM_PLAYER overlay; geometry diagnostic; terrain unverified
## X-License: All Rights Reserved (Juztie; see LICENSE.txt)
## SavedVariables: JuztLevelProfessionsDB, JuztLevelProfessionsDBBackup, JuztLevelP0LiveAuditDB
