## X-M5-Craft-History-Tracker-Build: 70374 (historical) + 70450 (current passive evidence)
## X-M25-Travel-Continuity: Reload-auto-resume of canonical source intent; live-origin replanning, no saved active route legs; zero auto-boarding
## X-M30-Enchant-One: Synchronous REPLACE_ENCHANT only; same-click protected/taint gate; no deferred popup action; client result required; manual fallback
## X-M24-Craft-Batch-Native-Safety: Single guarded ordinal; explicit user click; independent ledger/recovery and source review required; no automated continuation
## X-M23-Craft-Observation: Build70450 castGUID + exact output item event; operationID/itemGUID replay guard; no synthetic crafts
## X-M23-History: Exact cast proof de-duplication against native ledger; observed quantity is NOT confirmed craft count
## X-M6-Recipe-Reference-Build: 70450
## X-M34-Recipe-Field-Bundle: 70450 read-only correlated source evidence, no speculative yields/skill bands/vendor/spawn authority
## X-M7-Craft-Output-Yield-Build: 70450
## X-M7-Scope: Read-only source effect/yield reference and explicit live UI snapshot; zero native craft authority
## X-M7-Yield-Verification: 70450 DB2 effect bases are NOT server-certified item yields; external unpinned conflicts exposed; variable ranges require linked live TradeSkill UI or executed craft evidence
## X-M8-Skill-Difficulty-Build: 70450
## X-M8-Scope: Canonical build-70450 read-only yellow/grey source cutoffs; orange/green unknown; optional single-rank live UI color observation; no production authority
## X-M9-Item-Metadata-Build: 70450
## X-M9-Audit: 4919 item-ID records; 582 UNKNOWN names; 2 missing Item rows; 12947 reference relations; role-mask parity checked; no source promotion
## X-M9-Scope: 4919 item-ID reference records; 582 source-unknown names; 12947 relation rows; NPC acquisition unverified
## X-M21-Recipe-Sources: Teaching-item link exact for build 70450; vendor/trainer/drop server authority UNKNOWN without in-client UI observation
## X-M21-NPC-Coordinates: Non-Forever historical coordinates remain diagnostic only; current-client player coordinates are NOT NPC spawn coordinates
## X-M21-Permission: No vendor purchases, auto-navigation, crafting, persistent source promotion or drop-rate claims
## X-M9-Link-Evidence: Current observed client build and GetItemInfo hyperlink ItemID; source remains 70450, no synthetic clickable links or source promotion
## X-M13-Common-Navigation: Single qualified navigation request path; map waypoint preservation; independent handoff; no native crafting rights
## X-M12-Navigation-Map-QA: Read-only route/map/travel diagnostics; false-return API handling and finite zoom/pan; no native execution permissions
## X-M11-Catalogue-Qualification: Strict field-by-field 70374 provenance/rights admission; no new production permissions
